retyped_entities.description:
Some of {bed}'s controls changed type or options in this version. These automations and scripts still use them the old way:

{entities}

Edit each one to use the new entity or its new options. An under-bed light is now a light, so use the light actions instead of the switch actions. Then ignore this message.
